    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL SELECT para BigQuery que calcula la duración mínima, máxima y promedio de los episodios de fractura de cadera, estratificados por grupo de edad y género:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    CASE\n        WHEN (EXTRACT(YEAR FROM ce.condition_era_start_date) - p.year_of_birth) < 18 THEN '0-17'\n        WHEN (EXTRACT(YEAR FROM ce.condition_era_start_date) - p.year_of_birth) BETWEEN 18 AND 34 THEN '18-34'\n        WHEN (EXTRACT(YEAR FROM ce.condition_era_start_date) - p.year_of_birth) BETWEEN 35 AND 49 THEN '35-49'\n        WHEN (EXTRACT(YEAR FROM ce.condition_era_start_date) - p.year_of_birth) BETWEEN 50 AND 64 THEN '50-64'\n        ELSE '65+'\n    END AS age_group,\n    c_gender.concept_name AS gender,\n    MIN(DATE_DIFF(ce.condition_era_end_date, ce.condition_era_start_date, DAY)) AS min_duration_days,\n    MAX(DATE_DIFF(ce.condition_era_end_date, ce.condition_era_start_date, DAY)) AS max_duration_days,\n    AVG(CAST(DATE_DIFF(ce.condition_era_end_date, ce.condition_era_start_date, DAY) AS FLOAT64)) AS avg_duration_days\nFROM\n    `condition_era` AS ce\nJOIN\n    `person` AS p\nON\n    ce.person_id = p.person_id\nJOIN\n    `concept` AS c_gender\nON\n    p.gender_concept_id = c_gender.concept_id\nWHERE\n    ce.condition_concept_id IN (760688, 760691, 760692, 760694)\nGROUP BY\n    age_group,\n    gender\nORDER BY\n    age_group,\n    gender;\n```",
            "thoughtSignature": "Cq0BAY89a1_GERg38jSPYFlzZPBDgxBfI9QSMUuY8g4-2ijSWKOQMbStoE6Os6JaCVlRfZHqVNwIAXGjjZMNwRcljfWtV--N87Xu08zkZ2xhxzlqRK_cINCe5xTWWGQQ_H0iIOlGa24BcbpDVkQgFZL930stnOdfPy2S5csSZwnhjQqziXwIIklgaWcxe2-a2rxBS0u2QwJhMUkjsDqk1_QM1xIzbr8ISk7wjzsCmN4="
